{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DRoLw1UkIW1795656913.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>埃及吉薩發生嚴重車禍，至少31人死、逾20人傷。中國大使館指，未有收到中國公民傷亡報告。</p><p></p><p>埃及檢察部門指，一架運油車周三在開羅市郊的環城公路行駛期間突然失控翻側，之後引發大火，部分汽油潑灑到公路，波及現場廿多架車。部分傷者送去醫院搶救，他們受到灼傷或吸入濃煙不適。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.EGY.CRASH-0800_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mXskFRMfp31795656935.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>埃及總統塞西下令有關部門，全力救治傷者，支援遇難者家屬，盡快清理事故現場，採取必要措施保障公共安全。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.650704+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:37:14.299896+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:17.608883+00:00","content_hash":"36580649dd34eb9931cd07d41c384205012f08f9feacb248e5e71364562c4fde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.650704+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}